  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in cozy warmth and striking wildlife art with this custom wolf bedding set from Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully detailed native-inspired design, this quilt serves as both a comfortable layer for a restful night\\\\'s sleep and a stunning decorative statement piece for your bedroom or living space. Perfect for curling up on the sofa or adding a touch of rustic charm to your bed, it makes a thoughtful and unique gift for wolf lovers.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features customization options with a text input field to add your name or personal request.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Quality Print:</strong> Designed with colorful native themes on smooth material, creating a vibrant and detailed wolf design.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Soft, lightweight, breathable, and durable fabric that keeps you cool in summer and warm in winter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, including lounging on the couch, watching TV, camping, or picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water for quick, hassle-free cleaning and maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with one quilt, with the option to include two matching pillow covers (20\\\\\\'\\\\'x30\\\\\\'\\\\') to complete your bedding set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>30% Cotton / 70% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Wolf Native Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Western</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Subject Character</th>\n<td>Wolf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\\\\\\'\\\\'x70\\\\\\'\\\\'), Twin (68\\\\\"x86\\\\\"), Full (80\\\\\"x90\\\\\"), Queen (90\\\\\"x90\\\\\"), King (102\\\\\"x91\\\\\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
